text = "Spiky: light hits bounce off unless it's dizzy. Heavy (W), running slam and flash always hurt.
A hit knocks it up and pulls you after it: keep pressing Q / W to combo. Stop and it drops.
Empty its health mid-combo for the anime finisher (or jump at it when it sparkles).
Jump the shockwave. Let it roll into a wall, then punish it. Its crown shows its health."
horizontal_alignment = 1

